# Go for 9front (plan9/amd64 & plan9/arm64)

Pre-built Go toolchains for [9front](http://9front.org/) on amd64 and arm64.

Built from the in-progress
[plan9/arm64 port](https://go.dev/issue/76272) on top of upstream Go.

